{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hop into <i>SAGE</i>, a cozy co-op adventure game about frog wizards. Play solo or with up to 12 other wizards on a journey to become a SAGE.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434920/extras/a2a7312270c7df118567935d79ee7c10.poster.avif?t=1773166166\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434920/extras/a2a7312270c7df118567935d79ee7c10.webm?t=1773166166\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434920/extras/a2a7312270c7df118567935d79ee7c10.mp4?t=1773166166\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore a living world</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Becoming a SAGE means growing your magic  and learning to navigate the world. Progress from Novice to SAGE and unlock new magical abilities as you help the creatures of the forest amidst a rising darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434920/extras/08490b2d677d56231bedff4608cacad4.poster.avif?t=1773166166\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434920/extras/08490b2d677d56231bedff4608cacad4.webm?t=1773166166\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434920/extras/08490b2d677d56231bedff4608cacad4.mp4?t=1773166166\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Master the elements</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SAGE takes place in a world where weather and encounters are constantly shifting. You will explore to find resources, puzzles, and ingredients for fragrant teas to share with fellow adventurers. A cast of villagers and merchants will seek your help and guide you along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434920/extras/e1015ae18d11df072c1090d12bb37470.poster.avif?t=1773166166\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434920/extras/e1015ae18d11df072c1090d12bb37470.webm?t=1773166166\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434920/extras/e1015ae18d11df072c1090d12bb37470.mp4?t=1773166166\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cozy hangout spots!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fun co-op mechanics!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Public and private lobbies!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many tea recipes and spells to learn!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your staff and companions!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hundreds of unique cosmetic combinations!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Express yourself with emotes and animations!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Storybook-inspired visuals and a vibey soundtrack!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434920/extras/da0320fcb7b192fce3d8bb19635ce880.avif?t=1773166166\" width=617 height=164 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>